{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-2-Pose-Features","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"튜토리얼","anchor":"튜토리얼","identifiers":["doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-0-Project-Setup","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-1-Mock-Hand","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-4-Scoring-and-Coaching","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-6-Device-Tracking-and-Guide"],"generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"손이 방 어디에 있든, 어른 손이든 아이 손이든 같은 값이 나오게 만듭니다."}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"2. 관절을 22개의 숫자로"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"이 단계에서 새로 만드는 파일","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseFeature.swift"},{"text":" · ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseFeature+Angles.swift"},{"text":". 둘 다 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import ARKit"},{"text":"(관절 이름 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HandSkeleton.JointName"},{"text":")과 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import simd"},{"type":"text","text":"(벡터 연산 "},{"code":"dot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" · "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cross"},{"text":" · ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"length"},{"type":"text","text":")가 필요합니다."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"anchor":"21","type":"heading","text":"2.1","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"27개 관절 좌표를 그대로 쓰면 손 위치와 크기에 휘둘립니다. 그래서 ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"굽힘 15 + 벌림 4 + 손바닥 법선 3 = 22개","type":"text"}]},{"text":"의 숫자로 줄입니다.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseFeature.swift"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 22차원 특징"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import ARKit","import simd","","\/\/ …","","\/\/\/ 지화 한 글자를 판별하는 데 쓰는 22차원 특징.","struct PoseFeature: Equatable, Codable, Sendable {","    \/\/\/ 손가락 5개 × 관절 3개. 라디안. 편 손가락은 0에 가깝다.","    var bend: [Float]           \/\/ 15","    \/\/\/ 인접한 손가락 사이 벌림각. 라디안.","    var spread: [Float]         \/\/ 4","    \/\/\/ 손바닥 법선. 수향을 담는다. 정규화로 지우지 않는다.","    var palmNormal: SIMD3<Float> \/\/ 3","","    static let bendCount = 15","    static let spreadCount = 4","    static let dimension = bendCount + spreadCount + 3   \/\/ 22","    \/\/ …","}"],"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}]}],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true},{"text":"2.2","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"22"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"여기가 이 프로젝트에서 제일 중요한 판단입니다."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" 위치와 손 크기는 지우지만 "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"회전은 지우지 않습니다"}]},{"type":"text","text":". 흔히 쓰는 회전 정규화를 그대로 적용하면 손 모양이 같고 손바닥 방향만 다른 글자들이 서로 뭉개집니다."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"warning","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"⚠️ 몇 글자가 손바닥 방향으로 갈리는지는 국립국어원 한국수어사전에서 직접 확인하세요. 이 튜토리얼은 그 숫자를 검증하지 않았습니다."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Warning"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"PoseFeature.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — 손목을 원점으로 옮기고 손 크기로 나눈다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"lineAnnotations":[{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}]},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}]},{"range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}]},{"range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":29},{"line":29}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":30},{"line":30}]},{"range":[{"line":31},{"line":31}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":32},{"line":32}],"style":"highlight"}],"code":["import ARKit","import simd","","struct PoseFeature: Equatable, Codable, Sendable {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 손목을 원점으로 옮기고 손 크기로 나눈 뒤 각도를 잰다.","    \/\/\/ 왼손은 x축을 뒤집어 오른손 기준표 하나로 판정한다.","    static func extract(from skeleton: HandSkeleton,","                        chirality: HandAnchor.Chirality = .right) -> PoseFeature? {","        let wrist = skeleton.joint(.wrist)","        guard wrist.isTracked else { return nil }","","        let toLocal = wrist.anchorFromJointTransform.inverse","        let mirror: Float = (chirality == .left) ? -1 : 1","","        func local(_ name: HandSkeleton.JointName) -> SIMD3<Float> {","            let m = toLocal * skeleton.joint(name).anchorFromJointTransform","            var p = m.columns.3.xyz","            p.x *= mirror","            return p","        }","","        \/\/ 손 크기로 나눠 어른 손과 아이 손을 같은 자리에 놓는다.","        let span = length(local(.middleFingerKnuckle))","        guard span > 0.02 else { return nil }","","        let f = PoseFeature(bend: bendAngles(local),","                            spread: spreadAngles(local),","                            palmNormal: palmNormal(local))","        return f.isWellFormed ? f : nil","    }","}"]},{"level":3,"text":"2.3","anchor":"23","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"굽힘각은 세 관절이 이루는 각으로 잽니다. 편 손가락은 0에 가깝고, 접을수록 커집니다. 0으로 나누는 경우를 반드시 막아야 합니다 — 관절이 겹쳐 보이는 프레임이 실제로 들어옵니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"PoseFeature+Angles.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — 관절 세 개로 각 하나","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import ARKit","import simd","","\/\/\/ 세 관절이 이루는 굽힘각. 편 손가락은 0에 가깝다.","func jointAngle(_ a: SIMD3<Float>, _ b: SIMD3<Float>, _ c: SIMD3<Float>) -> Float {","    let u = a - b, v = c - b","    let lu = length(u), lv = length(v)","    guard lu > 1e-5, lv > 1e-5 else { return 0 }   \/\/ 0으로 나누기 방지","    return .pi - acos(clampf(dot(u, v) \/ (lu * lv), -1, 1))","}"],"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false,"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":4},{"line":4}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":5},{"line":5}]},{"range":[{"line":6},{"line":6}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"}]},{"text":"2.4","anchor":"24","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"손바닥 법선은 손목·검지너클·새끼너클 세 점의 외적으로 구합니다. 이 세 숫자가 수향을 담습니다."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"PoseFeature+Angles.swift","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — 수향을 담는 세 숫자","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import ARKit","import simd","","extension PoseFeature {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 손바닥 법선은 손목·검지너클·새끼너클 세 점의 외적으로 구한다.","    static func palmNormal(_ local: JointReader) -> SIMD3<Float> {","        let index = local(.indexFingerKnuckle)","        let little = local(.littleFingerKnuckle)","        let n = cross(index, little)","        let len = length(n)","        return len > 1e-5 ? n \/ len : SIMD3(0, 0, 1)","    }","}"],"wrap":0,"type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false,"copyToClipboard":true,"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}]},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}]},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"2.5","anchor":"25"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"굽힘 15개는 손가락마다 3개씩 뽑습니다.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" 관절 사슬을 손가락별로 미리 적어 두고, 앞에서 만든 "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"jointAngle"},{"type":"text","text":"을 세 번씩 돌립니다. 화면에 22개 숫자를 세 덩어리로 찍어 보면 — 손을 움직일 때 굽힘값이 따라 움직이고, 손을 돌릴 때 법선이 바뀌어야 합니다."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":"PoseFeature+Angles.swift","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — 손가락 5개 × 관절 3개 = 15"}]},{"lineAnnotations":[{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":7},{"line":7}]},{"range":[{"line":8},{"line":8}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":9},{"line":9}],"style":"highlight"},{"style":"highlight","range":[{"line":10},{"line":10}]},{"range":[{"line":11},{"line":11}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":12},{"line":12}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":13},{"line":13}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":14},{"line":14}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":15},{"line":15}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":16},{"line":16}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":17},{"line":17}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":18},{"line":18}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":19},{"line":19}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":20},{"line":20}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":21},{"line":21}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":22},{"line":22}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":23},{"line":23}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":24},{"line":24}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":25},{"line":25}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":26},{"line":26}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":27},{"line":27}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":28},{"line":28}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":29},{"line":29}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":30},{"line":30}],"style":"highlight"},{"range":[{"line":31},{"line":31}],"style":"highlight"}],"showLineNumbers":false,"type":"codeListing","code":["import ARKit","import simd","","extension PoseFeature {","    \/\/ …","","    \/\/\/ 손가락마다 3개씩, 뿌리에서 끝 방향으로 열다섯 개.","    static func bendAngles(_ local: JointReader) -> [Float] {","        var out: [Float] = []","        out.reserveCapacity(bendCount)","        for chain in jointChains {","            for i in 0..<3 {","                out.append(jointAngle(local(chain[i]), local(chain[i + 1]), local(chain[i + 2])))","            }","        }","        return out","    }","","    \/\/\/ [뿌리, 너클, 중간뿌리, 중간끝, 끝] 5개씩 × 5손가락.","    \/\/\/ 앞 세 점으로 첫 굽힘각을 재기 위해 뿌리 관절을 하나 더 앞에 둔다.","    static let jointChains: [[HandSkeleton.JointName]] = [","        [.wrist, .thumbKnuckle, .thumbIntermediateBase, .thumbIntermediateTip, .thumbTip],","        [.indexFingerMetacarpal, .indexFingerKnuckle, .indexFingerIntermediateBase,","         .indexFingerIntermediateTip, .indexFingerTip],","        [.middleFingerMetacarpal, .middleFingerKnuckle, .middleFingerIntermediateBase,","         .middleFingerIntermediateTip, .middleFingerTip],","        [.ringFingerMetacarpal, .ringFingerKnuckle, .ringFingerIntermediateBase,","         .ringFingerIntermediateTip, .ringFingerTip],","        [.littleFingerMetacarpal, .littleFingerKnuckle, .littleFingerIntermediateBase,","         .littleFingerIntermediateTip, .littleFingerTip]","    ]","}"],"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","wrap":0},{"text":"실행 결과","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EA%B2%B0%EA%B3%BC"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"2단계를 마치면 나오는 화면"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"step2.jpg"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"visionOS 26.2 시뮬레이터에서 직접 캡처"}],"type":"emphasis"}]},{"text":"체크포인트","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%8F%AC%EC%9D%B8%ED%8A%B8"},{"text":"여기까지 하면","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"%EC%97%AC%EA%B8%B0%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%ED%95%98%EB%A9%B4"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"굽힘 15개, 벌림 4개, 법선 3개가 모두 표시된다"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"합계가 22차원이라고 뜬다","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"안 되면 확인할 것","level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"%EC%95%88-%EB%90%98%EB%A9%B4-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8%ED%95%A0-%EA%B2%83"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".xyz"},{"text":"는 simd에 기본으로 없습니다. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SIMD4"},{"text":" 확장을 직접 만들어야 합니다 (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PoseFeature.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" 맨 위에 있습니다)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"값이 전부 0이면 손목 관절이 추적되지 않은 것입니다. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isTracked"},{"type":"text","text":"를 확인하세요."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Cannot find 'dot' in scope","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"code":"import simd","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"가 빠졌습니다."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"계속하기","anchor":"%EA%B3%84%EC%86%8D%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor","type":"reference","isActive":true}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-3-Reference-Poses","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"references":{"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters":{"url":"\/documentation\/jihwatutor\/step-5-expand-to-40-characters","abstract":[{"text":"한 글자가 되면 나머지는 표를 채우는 일입니다. 다만 채우면서 무엇이 서로 헷갈리는지 기록해야 합니다.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/JihwaTutor\/documentation\/JihwaTutor\/Step-5-Expand-to-40-Characters","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"5. 40자로 늘린다"},"doc://JihwaTutor/documentation/JihwaTutor/Step-1-Mock-Hand":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/jihwatutor\/step-1-mock-hand","role":"article","kind":"a